 "notes": "All nine planned kinds kept (k97–k104 plus new Classic wooden runabout). Kind sources moved to retrieved Wikipedia pages where available; Deck boat keeps its old source and has no archetype (no retrieved page named a deck-boat icon). Old Sea-Doo SKU list folded into the Sea-Doo archetype as versions; near-duplicate trims (Spark X, Wake, FishPro Sport) dropped; old Sea-Doo ranges moved to the brand register as lines. Old Lift models (LIFT5, LIFTX) are versions of Lift eFoil. Boston Whaler 13/Montauk left out of this shelf: it is a foam-cored outboard utility/centre-console boat and belongs with Centre console boat (Fishing boats shelf); brand entry given for that worker (source https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Boston_Whaler). Not included for lack of a retrievable source: Fountain model names, MasterCraft ProStar/X-Star years (official PDF layout too garbled to tie years to models), Riva Florida/Super Florida, Kawasaki Ultra/STX, Sea-Doo GTX/RXP years. Bennington.com and Polaris pages blocked (403); Bennington facts from its 2008 brochure on the Polaris CDN. Founding year for Bennington left blank (only a forum/directory source)."
